  <item>
    <title>EP79|娱乐圈2025年终大盘点，我们来对打春晚啦~</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698dd8d466e2c303773bc333</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698dd8d466e2c303773bc333</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Feb 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【不知名脑电波】</span></p><span></span><p><span>“难忘，今宵，难忘今宵~”</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家好久不见呀，在这辞旧迎新的一天，让我们陪大家一起，来盘一盘往年娱乐圈都出了什么“大”新闻吧。希望新的一年，内娱能给我们带来更多优秀的作品，以及，贡献更多的乐子！</span></p><span></span><p><span>也祝愿屏幕那边的你们新年健康多多、快乐多多、money多多~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【声音目录】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="101">01:41</a> 年度星光人物：梓瑜、田栩宁、肖战（排名分先后）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="482">08:02</a> 建议白鹿依旧留在偶像剧赛道再战两年，谁赞成谁反对！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="664">11:04</a> 2025必聊榜：赵露思和虞书欣的“此消彼长”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1516">25:16</a> 棣欣引力、禹宙中欣纷纷解绑，“苦海~翻起爱恨~”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1723">28:43</a> 祝鞠姐早日解约，从年初到年尾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1939">32:19</a> 鹿晗和关晓彤今天分手了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">38:20</a> 恭喜成毅取代壮壮哥哥登上杉树“最喜爱明星top1”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2639">43:59</a> 锐评：赵姐居然也有无效播剧的一年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2767">46:07</a> 迪丽热巴依旧在努力派出代表作的路上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3051">50:51</a> 恭喜幂姐结束水逆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3680">1:01:20</a> 年末男星大塌房，居然有檀健次？</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025十大未解之谜：王一博还回内娱吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4337">1:12:17</a> 谁还记得开年第一“爆”剧——《难哄》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4691">1:18:11</a> 顶“刘”来了，综艺电视剧双开花的一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5360">1:29:20</a> 陈星旭也是年龄到了，自动升咖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5857">1:37:37</a> 祖儿回归，统统闪开！（不接男主运）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5970">1:39:30</a> 微博king&amp;queen谜底已揭晓，主包还是猜的太准了</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：不知名FM</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：bzmfm111@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：刀了个刀、叁叁而川</span></p>]]></description>
