    <pubDate>Fri, 04 Jul 2025 12:03:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【不知名脑电波】</span></p><span></span><p><span>腾讯视频的招商大会在6月如期而至，大规模发布会的盛况吸引了无数眼球。有顶流携新剧来袭，引爆全网热搜；有小花惊艳亮相，解锁全新角色；更有超人气IP改编剧集重磅官宣。从校园纯恋到都市偶像，从奇幻冒险到轻喜甜宠，青春气息扑面而来！我们来一起看看，在这场盛会上，究竟有哪些新剧的亮相呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【片单目录】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a> 《造城者》（赵丽颖，黄晓明）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">06:13</a> 《太平年》（白宇，周雨彤）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a> 《骄阳似我》（宋威龙、赵今麦）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1099">18:19</a> 《独身女人》（唐嫣，赵又廷）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1469">24:29</a> 《许我耀眼》(赵露思，陈伟霆）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1885">31:25</a> 《实用主义者的爱情》（陈飞宇，孙千）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2142">35:42</a> 《我们与法庭的距离》（龚俊，任敏）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2364">39:24</a> 《狙击蝴蝶》（陈妍希，周柯宇）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2673">44:33</a> 《利剑玫瑰》（迪丽热巴，金世佳）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2899">48:19</a> 《吴邪私家笔记》（吴镇宇，徐振轩）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3152">52:32</a> 《哑舍》（高伟光，梁靖康）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a>《慕胥辞》（迪丽热巴，陈飞宇）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：不知名FM</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：bzmfm111@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：刀了个刀、叁叁而川</span></p>]]></description>
